### Page 1 of 5

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 19, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-21-23 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne
and Miller & Sons Construction, Inc. for the 2023 Miscellaneous Concrete project
 ______________________________________________
Bid #S-21-23 was solicited for the 2023 Miscellaneous Concrete project.  Project vicinity map
included.

Four (4) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1. Miller & Sons Construction Inc.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
2. S & S Builders LLC.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
3. Reiman Corp.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
4. Simon Contractors.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by Doug Klahn (1% Construction), and Tom Cobb (Engineering) and
their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Miller & Sons Construction Inc.,
Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The total Bid Award amount is $1,013,150.98

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-43492 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Misc. Concrete)
```

